{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/sizing/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Easily make an element as wide or as tall with our width and height utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"relative-to-the-parent","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the parent","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Width and height utilities are generated from the utility API in <code>_utilities.scss</code>. Includes support for <code>25%</code>, <code>50%</code>, <code>75%</code>, <code>100%</code>, and <code>auto</code> by default. Modify those values as you need to generate different utilities here."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-1","type":"demo","key":"54dab187e74fc494637a","height":300},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-25 p-3\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\">Width auto</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-2","type":"demo","key":"232981bc865c864843c1","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height auto</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>max-height: 100%;</code> utilities as needed."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-3","type":"demo","key":"45294ecf0b06ae364fad","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"width: 50%; height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"mw-100\" style=\"width: 200%;\">Max-width 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-4","type":"demo","key":"cc9a16bb31cc5a6cff14","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-4","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px;\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the viewport","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use utilities to set the width and height relative to the viewport."},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"min-vw-100\">Min-width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"min-vh-100\">Min-height 100vh</div>\n<div class=\"vw-100\">Width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"vh-100\">Height 100vh</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Sizing utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"width\": (\n  property: width,\n  class: w,\n  values: (\n    25: 25%,\n    50: 50%,\n    75: 75%,\n    100: 100%,\n    auto: auto\n  )\n),\n\"max-width\": (\n  property: max-width,\n  class: mw,\n  values: (100: 100%)\n),\n\"viewport-width\": (\n  property: width,\n  class: vw,\n  values: (100: 100vw)\n),\n\"min-viewport-width\": (\n  property: min-width,\n  class: min-vw,\n  values: (100: 100vw)\n),\n\"height\": (\n  property: height,\n  class: h,\n  values: (\n    25: 25%,\n    50: 50%,\n    75: 75%,\n    100: 100%,\n    auto: auto\n  )\n),\n\"max-height\": (\n  property: max-height,\n  class: mh,\n  values: (100: 100%)\n),\n\"viewport-height\": (\n  property: height,\n  class: vh,\n  values: (100: 100vh)\n),\n\"min-viewport-height\": (\n  property: min-height,\n  class: min-vh,\n  values: (100: 100vh)\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"54dab187e74fc494637a","html":" <div class=\"w-25 p-3\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\">Width auto</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bd-example-flex"},"sprite":""},{"key":"232981bc865c864843c1","html":" <div style=\"height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px;\">Height auto</div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bd-example-flex"},"sprite":""},{"key":"45294ecf0b06ae364fad","html":" <div style=\"width: 50%; height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"mw-100\" style=\"width: 200%;\">Max-width 100%</div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bd-example-flex"},"sprite":""},{"key":"cc9a16bb31cc5a6cff14","html":" <div style=\"height: 100px;\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px;\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 bd-example-flex"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Brow